  "HDDS-6046": {
    "jira_id": "HDDS-6046",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Implemented",
    "title": "Multi-threaded validator for freon RandomKeyGenerator.",
    "description": "Freon RandomKeyGenerator has a single-threaded validator, it reads written keys and verify their checksums.\r\n\r\nBut it may takes a lot of times to do validation when we have a lot of keys written, so there should be a option to have a faster multi-threaded validator.\r\n\r\nBTW, after introducing a multi-threaded validator, freon RandomKeyGenerator could be used as a benchmark tool to test high concurrent read and write.",
    "commits": [
